## Sound Alerts

The app plays audio tones for critical events. Make sure:

- **iPhone:** Your phone does **not** need to be on silent — the app overrides the silent switch for clinical alerts
- **Android:** Volume should be turned up; the app will vibrate as well as play tones

**Tone guide:**
| Alert | Sound |
|-------|-------|
| Pre-charge defibrillator (1:45) | Two rising tones |
| Pulse/Rhythm check (2:00) | Three descending beeps |
| CPR pause 8 seconds | Single soft tap |
| CPR pause 10 seconds | Three urgent beeps |
| Epinephrine due (3 min) | Two medium rising tones |
| Epinephrine overdue (5 min) | Three buzzing tones |

---

## Updates

When the app is updated, you may need to:
1. Close the app completely (swipe away from app switcher)
2. Reopen from the home screen icon

If an update still doesn't appear, delete the icon and reinstall using the steps above.

